Homepage: https://github.com/artemimennoi/awgbar
Description: AmneziaWG VPN client in the tray
 AWG Bar connects to AmneziaWG servers from a tray icon: import an AmneziaVPN
 key (vpn://...) or an AmneziaWG .conf and press Connect.
 .
 A small root service runs the tunnel (amneziawg-go, built in) and watches
 sleep, wake-up and network changes, so the VPN comes back by itself after the
 laptop wakes up or moves to another network.
